{"title":"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/f/d3fc93b8ee594418078878bdd062d66625965e0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1=\\{(x,y)|\\log_{10}(1+x^2+y^2)\\le 1+\\log_{10}(x+y)\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"399\" height=\"19\" />\nand \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/a/18a637503eddd87e3ce6303c51c0889578137713.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2=\\{(x,y)|\\log_{10}(2+x^2+y^2)\\le 2+\\log_{10}(x+y)\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"399\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>What is the ratio of the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4caea56d945d0b6e49701b42ce06e0fb92e663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> to the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b10d5ee88ffc7d59f9c282b366953fb4fa4051f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/1/3e10f0c2a5863ffecfe6b1e0e34a6d276061e3d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 98\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 99\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 100\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 101\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ }  102$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"414\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Looking at the constraints of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b10d5ee88ffc7d59f9c282b366953fb4fa4051f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/4/c8428959aacc9e0ad5512ebfcaa7fd6c4bed7a00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/8/188997a5208b244950fb734d2456a67a50db08b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}(1+x^2+y^2)\\le 1+\\log_{10}(x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"288\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/f/a3f8c02e1337513bc170ee9ce5a6cf8ac5a21d9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}(1+x^2+y^2)\\le \\log_{10} 10 +\\log_{10}(x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"341\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/e/6beee7198fcc98dd80fd2df00ca8dbcf3677a591.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}(1+x^2+y^2)\\le \\log_{10}(10x+10y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"293\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/5/8b52b467c984ef9cd882c670a2b7bf64a7c7d58a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+x^2+y^2 \\le 10x+10y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"190\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/0/610d3a9a06e9b52a13c2e215a49c3d29043040bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-10x+y^2-10y \\le -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"204\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/f/c2f5c1abb84197bee43b209ac24800d33360362f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-10x+25+y^2-10y+25 \\le 49$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"280\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d87910d7b871ee24cae33babfaa9d0e7034f185.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-5)^2 + (y-5)^2 \\le (7)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"201\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b10d5ee88ffc7d59f9c282b366953fb4fa4051f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> is a circle with a radius of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. So, the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b10d5ee88ffc7d59f9c282b366953fb4fa4051f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/9/989c1024557838c086f0bb2c1f53e496cfaced8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Looking at the constraints of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4caea56d945d0b6e49701b42ce06e0fb92e663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/4/c8428959aacc9e0ad5512ebfcaa7fd6c4bed7a00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/2/402fbc600fbe930a8f7982534f0cbfc9d0d74820.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}(2+x^2+y^2)\\le 2+\\log_{10}(x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"288\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/9/1892f7cd65e19cd2757063dd3bc8d45769f6f711.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}(2+x^2+y^2)\\le \\log_{10} 100 +\\log_{10}(x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"350\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/6/5461d57aa1382d1d4523cc0aea63c78c012cc58b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{10}(2+x^2+y^2)\\le \\log_{10}(100x+100y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"311\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/b/b0b05853068ff8298d8f337fc5417d19090be498.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+x^2+y^2 \\le 100x+100y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"208\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/1/e515265b9692c3327bb56fdeb11b5a67950be7fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-100x+y^2-100y \\le -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"223\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4d37bcb595725814324ca52067926c547c3a9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-100x+2500+y^2-100y+2500 \\le 4998$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"353\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/7/bf7b3318d592421cba4660dff97234a2ee47be5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-50)^2 + (y-50)^2 \\le (7\\sqrt{102})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"262\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4caea56d945d0b6e49701b42ce06e0fb92e663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> is a circle with a radius of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/2/892521ea813888521d59f16cb17f546cacaa2460.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7\\sqrt{102}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" />. So, the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/4/7f4caea56d945d0b6e49701b42ce06e0fb92e663.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da386c867b551bfb5aa1ad5fca0fbdfc54003cf7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4998\\pi$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>So the desired ratio is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/4/9746b998ed253b4e02c83fac35afe1a8e3f2f9a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4998\\pi}{49\\pi} = 102 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"157\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A\">2006 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</